{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46196","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五岳烟霞连不断，三山洞穴去应通。\n石窗欹枕疎疎雨，水碓无人浩浩风。\n童子念经深竹里，猕猴拾蝨夕阳中。\n因思往事抛心力，六七年来楚水东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}